n the configuration deletion has been started for cases when the deletion needs to be settled/approved by partners, such as when marketplace invoices have been paid.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"deletedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was deleted.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"disabledAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was disabled. Note: Configurations can be disabled when the associated user loses access to a team. They do not function during this time until the configuration is 'transferred', meaning the associated user is changed to one with access to the team.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"disabledReason\":{\"enum\":[\"account-plan-downgrade\",\"disabled-by-admin\",\"disabled-by-owner\",\"feature-not-available\",\"original-owner-left-the-team\",\"original-owner-role-downgraded\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"externalId\":{\"description\":\"An external identifier defined by the integration vendor.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the configuration\",\"example\":\"icfg_3bwCLgxL8qt5kjRLcv2Dit7F\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"installationType\":{\"description\":\"Defines the installation type. - 'external' integrations are installed via the existing integrations flow - 'marketplace' integrations are natively installed: - when accepting the TOS of a partner during the store creation process - if undefined, assume 'external'\",\"enum\":[\"external\",\"marketplace\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"integrationId\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the app the configuration was created for\",\"example\":\"oac_xzpVzcUOgcB1nrVlirtKhbWV\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"ownerId\":{\"description\":\"The user or team ID that owns the configuration\",\"example\":\"kr1PsOIzqEL5Xg6M4VZcZosf\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"projects\":{\"description\":\"When a configuration is limited to 