r defined by the integration vendor.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the configuration\",\"example\":\"icfg_3bwCLgxL8qt5kjRLcv2Dit7F\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"installationType\":{\"description\":\"Defines the installation type. - 'external' integrations are installed via the existing integrations flow - 'marketplace' integrations are natively installed: - when accepting the TOS of a partner during the store creation process - if undefined, assume 'external'\",\"enum\":[\"external\",\"marketplace\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"integrationId\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the app the configuration was created for\",\"example\":\"oac_xzpVzcUOgcB1nrVlirtKhbWV\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"ownerId\":{\"description\":\"The user or team ID that owns the configuration\",\"example\":\"kr1PsOIzqEL5Xg6M4VZcZosf\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"projects\":{\"description\":\"When a configuration is limited to access certain projects, this will contain each of the project ID it is allowed to access. If it is not defined, the configuration has full access.\",\"example\":[\"prj_xQxbutw1HpL6HLYPAzt5h75m8NjO\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"scopes\":{\"description\":\"The resources that are allowed to be accessed by the configuration.\",\"example\":[\"read:project\",\"read-write:log-drain\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"slug\":{\"description\":\"The slug of the integration the configuration is created for.\",\"example\":\"slack\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"Source defines where the configuration was installed from. It is used to analyze user engagement for integration installations in product metrics.\",\"enum\":[\"backoffice\",\"cli\",\"deploy-button\",\"external\",\"import-recommended-integrations\",\"marketplace\",\"oauth\",\"organization\",\"resource-claims\",\"v0\"],\"example\":\"marketplace\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"description\":\"The configuration status. Optional. If not defined, assume 'ready'.\",\"enum\":[\"error\",\"onboarding\",\"pending\",\"ready\",\"resumed\",\"suspended\",\"uninstalled\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"teamId\":{\"description\":\"When the configuration was created for a team, this will show the ID of the team.\",\"example\":\"team_nLlpyC6RE1qxydlFKbrxDlud\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"enum\":[\"integration-configuration\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"updatedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was updated.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"userId\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the user that created the configuration.\",\"example\":\"kr1PsOIzqEL5Xg6M4VZcZosf\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"createdAt\",\"id\",\"integrationId\",\"ownerId\",\"scopes\",\"slug\",\"type\",\"updatedAt\",\"userId\"],\"type\":\"object\"},{\"description\":\"A configuration represents information about a single installation of an integration within an individual or team account\",\"properties\":{\"acceptedPoliciesInheritedFromInstallationId\":{\"description\":\"Historical parent installation from which acceptedPolicies were inherited. This is immutable provenance, not current authorization or relationship truth.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"completedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was installed successfully\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"createdAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was created\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"customerDeleteRequestedAt\":{\"description\":\"Record when the customer initited deletion, independent of whether `deleteRequestedAt` gets set.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"deleteRequestedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration deletion has been started for cases when the deletion needs to be settled/approved by partners, such as when marketplace invoices have been paid.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"deletedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was deleted.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"disabledAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was disabled. Note: Configurations can be disabled when the associated user loses access to a team. They do not function during this time until the configuration is 'transferred', meaning the associated user is changed to one with access to the team.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"disabledReason\":{\"enum\":[\"account-plan-downgrade\",\"disabled-by-admin\",\"disabled-by-owner\",\"feature-not-available\",\"original-owner-left-the-team\",\"original-owner-role-downgraded\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"externalId\":{\"description\":\"An external identifier defined by the integration vendor.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the configuration\",\"example\":\"icfg_3bwCLgxL8qt5kjRLcv2Dit7F\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"installationType\":{\"description\":\"Defines the installation type. - 'external' integrations are installed via the existing integrations flow - 'marketplace' integrations are natively installed: - when accepting the TOS of a partner during the store creation process - if undefined, assume 'external'\",\"enum\":[\"external\",\"marketplace\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"integrationId\":{\"description\":\"The unique identifier of the app the configuration was created for\",\"example\":\"oac_xzpVzcUOgcB1nrVlirtKhbWV\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"ownerId\":{\"description\":\"The user or team ID that owns the configuration\",\"example\":\"kr1PsOIzqEL5Xg6M4VZcZosf\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"projects\":{\"description\":\"When a configuration is limited to access certain projects, this will contain each of the project ID it is allowed to access. If it is not defined, the configuration has full access.\",\"example\":[\"prj_xQxbutw1HpL6HLYPAzt5h75m8NjO\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"scopes\":{\"description\":\"The resources that are allowed to be accessed by the configuration.\",\"example\":[\"read:project\",\"read-write:log-drain\"],\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"slug\":{\"description\":\"The slug of the integration the configuration is created for.\",\"example\":\"slack\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"Source defines where the configuration was installed from. It is used to analyze user engagement for integration installations in product metrics.\",\"enum\":[\"backoffice\",\"cli\",\"deploy-button\",\"external\",\"import-recommended-integrations\",\"marketplace\",\"oauth\",\"organization\",\"resource-claims\",\"v0\"],\"example\":\"marketplace\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"description\":\"The configuration status. Optional. If not defined, assume 'ready'.\",\"enum\":[\"error\",\"onboarding\",\"pending\",\"ready\",\"resumed\",\"suspended\",\"uninstalled\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"teamId\":{\"description\":\"When the configuration was created for a team, this will show the ID of the team.\",\"example\":\"team_nLlpyC6RE1qxydlFKbrxDlud\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"enum\":[\"integration-configuration\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"updatedAt\":{\"description\":\"A timestamp that tells you when the configuration was updated.\",\"example\":1558531915505,\"type\":\"number\"},\"userId\":{\"description\":\"The ID of the user that created the configuration.\",\"example\":\"kr1PsOIzqEL5Xg6M4VZcZosf\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}]}}},\"description\":\"The configuration with the provided id\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"One of the provided values in the request query is invalid.\"},\"401\":{\"description\":\"The request is not authorized.\"},\"403\":{\"description\":\"You do not have permission to access this resource.\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"The configuration was not found\"},\"410\":{